摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Local-first automation Agent & deterministic workflow engine — the secure control layer between AI and your data. Data stays local. Connect your own LLM / files / notes / databases via Connector API. ReAct reasoning · DAG/WAL/Saga/idempotent execution · MCP · offline-capable.","id":"gh:552259791","install_available":false,"language":"Go","name":"aflare","slug":"alib8b8/aflare","topics":["agent","automation","connector","dag","data-protection","dsh","dsh-plugin","files","go","llm","local-first","mcp","notes","offline","ollama","personal-data","privacy","rag","saga","sqlite"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Local-first automation Agent & deterministic workflow engine — the secure control layer between AI a"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"nd your data. Data stays local. Connect your own LLM / files / notes / databases via Connector API. "},{"id":"p1s3","text":"ReAct reasoning · DAG/WAL/Saga/idempotent execution · MCP · offline-capable."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"aflare"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English ·\n简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"AI Beyond Chat — Get Things Done\nLocal-first · Data Stays Local · Connect Your Own LLM / Files / Not"},{"id":"p4s2","text":" — Get Things Done\nLocal-first · Data Stays Local · Connect Your Own LLM / Files / Notes / Databases"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Quick Start"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"**macOS / Linux:**"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"**Windows (PowerShell):**"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Other install methods (manual download / deb · rpm / GitHub Action)"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"- `deb` / `rpm` packages are attached to each Release.\n- The install script auto-switches to mirror-"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"accelerated downloads on CN networks."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Run aflare workflows as CI steps (checksum-verified binary, no Docker build):"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"See action/README.md."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"**Try it in 60 seconds:**"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"> Optional: install bubblewrap for full sandbox isolation (`code_interpreter` node) — `sudo apt inst"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"all bubblewrap` / `brew install bubblewrap`.\n>\n> Market data in generated monitoring workflows comes"},{"id":"p18s3","text":" from public quote APIs — for personal research only, not investment advice."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## What is aflare?"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"A **local-first automation Agent** and a **deterministic workflow engine** in a single binary. You e"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"xplicitly grant access to your data (directories, note libraries, local databases), and the AI works"},{"id":"p20s3","text":" deterministically inside the permission ceiling you define."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Currently at **v0.12.0**, targeting local users first — local data lives on your machine, aflare is "},{"id":"p22s2","text":"the deterministic and secure control layer between AI and that data."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Key Features"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"- **Local-first, data stays local** — single binary, zero runtime deps, ~10–30MB RAM; workflows, his"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"tory, memory and secrets all stay on local disk; fully offline-capable; no usage telemetry.\n- **Conn"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"ect your own LLM** — Ollama / vLLM / LM Studio / any OpenAI-compatible endpoint; loopback needs no A"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"PI key; without an LLM, keyword matching keeps everything working offline. Multi-provider routing cu"},{"id":"p24s5","text":"ts spend and avoids lock-in: one OpenRouter endpoint for every vendor's models, or the native `llm_r"},{"id":"p24s6","text":"outer` node routing by cost / latency with automatic fallback. See LLM Routing.\n- **Local data & API"},{"id":"p24s7","text":" connectors** — named, explicitly-authorized connectors for directories, databases and HTTP APIs (`f"},{"id":"p24s8","text":"iles` / `notes` / `sqlite` / `mysql` / `postgres` / `http`); credentials live only in the secrets st"},{"id":"p24s9","text":"ore, permission ceilings can be tightened but never loosened. See Connector API.\n- **Deterministic r"},{"id":"p24s10","text":"untime** — DAG parallel scheduling (TLA+ formally verified), WAL crash recovery + `--resume`, Saga t"},{"id":"p24s11","text":"ransaction compensation, idempotency, retry / rate limit / circuit breaker. Every operation is trace"},{"id":"p24s12","text":"able, replayable, verifiable.\n- **Dual Agent + Workflow mode** — conversational ReAct Agent (`aflare"},{"id":"p24s13","text":" chat`) and daemon Agent (`aflare agent`) share one core; 6 pluggable capabilities (reflection / hum"},{"id":"p24s14","text":"an-in-the-loop / utility / memory / planning / workflow).\n- **Agent interconnection & commanding** —"},{"id":"p24s15","text":" aflare directs and supervises other agents: CLI channel (`codex` / `claude` / `gemini` or any gener"},{"id":"p24s16","text":"ic CLI) and A2A protocol channel, with real delegation via the `supervisor` node and failure isolati"},{"id":"p24s17","text":"on per agent.\n- **Security built in** — HMAC tamper-evident audit chain, AES-GCM encrypted secrets, "},{"id":"p24s18","text":"automatic secret redaction, SSRF / path-traversal / command-injection defenses, outbound anomaly mon"},{"id":"p24s19","text":"itoring + auto circuit-break, four security levels (L0–L3).\n- **Extensible ecosystem** — MCP Server "},{"id":"p24s20","text":"/ Client, custom nodes in Go, community plugins, GitHub Action for CI, 30+ built-in LLM providers, O"},{"id":"p24s21","text":"penClaw plugin for the OpenClaw ecosystem.\n- **Ready-to-run examples** — real-world workflow packs u"},{"id":"p24s22","text":"nder `examples/real-world/`: industrial monitoring (OpenFOAM divergence watchdog, similarity-RAG inc"},{"id":"p24s23","text":"ident triage), DevOps CI pipelines, research, batch processing, multi-agent role pipelines (analyst→"},{"id":"p24s24","text":"researcher→trader→risk trading crew, digital-company marketing & sales departments), and AI after-sa"},{"id":"p24s25","text":"les customer service (emotion detection → product disambiguation → photo error-code OCR → RAG troubl"},{"id":"p24s26","text":"eshooting → self-fix or escalation → ticket archiving, fully offline-capable via layer-by-layer fall"},{"id":"p24s27","text":"ing → self-fix or escalation → ticket archiving, fully offline-capable via layer-by-layer fallback)."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Security"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Four security levels (`--security-level`): **L0** relaxed → **L3** maximum (L2 refuses unsandboxed `"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"code_interpreter`; L3 disables it). CI runs `gofmt` / `go vet` / `gosec` / `govulncheck` on every PR"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"ode_interpreter`; L3 disables it). CI runs `gofmt` / `go vet` / `gosec` / `govulncheck` on every PR."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Security Guide →"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## Documentation"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"- Getting Started · Tutorial · YAML Syntax\n- Dataflow · Scheduling · MCP · Plugins · Connectors · LL"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"M Routing\n- Web UI · Visualizer · Custom Nodes\n- API Reference · Nodes Reference\n- Deployment · Dock"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"er · Multi-Tenancy\n- Troubleshooting · Changelog"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Contributing"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"We welcome contributions! Contributing →"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## License — Dual Licensing"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"aflare ships under a dual license:"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"- **Community Edition** — GNU AGPL v3.0, free (LICENSE). Note AGPL §13: offering aflare-based functi"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"onality as a service triggers source-disclosure obligations for the entire combined work.\n- **Commer"},{"id":"p34s3","text":"cial License** — for embedding aflare in closed-source products or SaaS without AGPL obligations (LI"},{"id":"p34s4","text":"CENSE-COMMERCIAL.md, local_first_agent@126.com)."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"GitHub"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"Issues"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"Discussions"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
